  "description": "A high-performance, fully managed Redis client for .NET, incorporating both synchronous and asynchronous usage. Connection multiplexing across a cluster, sentinel and replica topologies, the full command surface including streams and vector sets, RESP2 and RESP3, pub/sub, transactions, batches and Lua scripting, a low-level RESP protocol layer, and the Redlock distributed-lock algorithm. Roslyn analyzers and their IDE code fixes ship inside the package.",
